  "contentHtml": "\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <p><img src=\"https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/et-default-user.svg\" alt=\"Teena Thacker\">\n                                            \n                                        </p>\n                                                                        \n                                                                                    <ul>\n                                                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                                                                            <a>Teena Thacker</a>\n                                                            \n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \n                                                                                                            </li>\n                                                                                                                                                    <li><a href=\"/agency/88675387/ET-Bureau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ET Bureau</a></li>\n                                                                                            </ul>\n                                                                                <ul>\n                                                                                            <li>Published On Oct 17, 2026 at 07:14 AM IST</li>\n                                                                                                                                            <li>\n                                                        \n                                                            \n                                                                Read by \n                                                            \n                                                            100 Professionals\n                                                        \n                                                    </li>\n                                                                                    </ul>\n                                    \n                                                                            \n                                                                        \n                                \n                                \n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>New Delhi: The <a href=\"/tag/niti+aayog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NITI Aayog</a> is exploring comprehensive policy interventions to boost <a href=\"/tag/domestic+manufacturing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">domestic manufacturing</a> of medical and dental devices in the country.With a focus on addressing <a href=\"/tag/regulatory+hurdles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">regulatory hurdles</a>, infrastructure gaps and cost disadvantages faced by Indian manufacturers, the government's public policy think tank held a meeting on Wednesday with domestic devices and dental manufacturers, government officials from the departments of pharmaceuticals, health, science and technology, and the <a href=\"/tag/indian+council+of+medical+research\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Indian Council of Medical Research</a>, as well as experts from IIT Delhi and IIT Mumbai. E-commerce platforms involved in the trade of dental devices and the <a href=\"/tag/association+of+indian+medical+device+industry+%28aimed%29\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Association of Indian Medical Device Industry (AiMeD)</a> also participated in the meeting.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M -->\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>Chaired by NITI Aayog vice chairman Ashok Lahiri, the meeting focused on identifying key challenges in domestic manufacturing and exploring regulatory, infrastructural and fiscal interventions needed to strengthen India's medical and dental device industry.The consultation also aimed to identify opportunities for collaboration between the government and industry, and to formulate recommendations aligned with the country's <a href=\"/tag/healthcare+priorities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">healthcare priorities</a>.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>In a presentation submitted to the Aayog, the AiMeD called for a dedicated law for medical devices, simpler regulatory approvals and financial support to help domestic manufacturers compete with imported products.</p><p>The industry body said Indian manufacturers face a 10-15% cost disadvantage due to high capital and energy costs, logistics expenses, limited access to risk capital and inadequate testing and research infrastructure.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>It also flagged the increasing regulatory burden, noting that setting up a manufacturing facility, which previously took about 18 months, can now take nearly four years because of multiple approvals, overlapping authorities and changing requirements.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Teena Thacker</span>,</li> -->\n                                    \n\n                                                                            <li>By\n                                                                                            <a>Teena Thacker</a>\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                        , \n                                                                                    </li>\n                                                                        <li><a href=\"/agency/88675387/ET-Bureau\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ET Bureau</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                                <ul>\n                                    <!-- <li> Updated On Oct 17, 2026 at 07:14 AM IST</li> -->\n                                    <li>Published On Oct 17, 2026 at 07:14 AM IST</li>\n                                    <!-- <li class=\"desktop-view\">1 min read</li> -->\n                                </ul>\n                            \n                                        \n\n                    \n\n                    <!-- Comment Section -->\n                                            \n                                        <!-- Comment Section -->\n\n                    \n                      \n    \n            <p>\n                </p><h2>Join the community of 2M+ industry professionals. </h2>   \n                <h3>Subscribe to Newsletter to get latest insights &amp; analysis in your inbox.</h3>\n            <p></p>\n\n            <!-- <figure class=\"top-newsletter-subs__icon-nl\" role=\"presentation\" aria-label=\"Newsletter icon\">\n                <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-newsletter.svg\" alt=\"Newsletter icon\" width=\"55\" height=\"55\">\n            </figure> -->\n        \n            \n                \n                    <h2>All about ETHealthworld industry right on your smartphone! </h2>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><a href=\"/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the ETHealthworld App</a> and get the Realtime updates and Save your favourite articles.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                                            <!-- <div class=\"app-store-container desktop-view\">\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"\" aria-label=\"Play Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-g-play.png\" alt=\"\" />\n                            </a>\n                            <a href=\"/app\" title=\"App Store\">\n                                <img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/icons/icon-app-store.png\" alt=\"\" />\n                            </a>\n                        </div>    -->\n                         \n                \n                                    <figure>\n                        <!-- <i></i>\n                        <span class=\"scan-text\">Scan to download App</span> -->\n                        <img src=\"https://st.etb2bimg.com/Themes/Release/theme4/images/bar-codes/health_barcode.png?mod=3485\" alt=\"\">                        \n                        <!-- <span class=\"border-bottom\"></span> -->\n                    </figure>\n                            \n       \n\n\n                    \n                \n            "
